            <title>[LU-21263] kernel update [RHEL 10.2 6.12.0-211.74.1.el10_2]</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21263</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Security Fix(es) for kernel 6.12.0-211.74.1.el10_2:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: writeback: fix race between cgroup_writeback_umount() and inode_switch_wbs() (CVE-2026-64378)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: sunrpc: pin svc_xprt across the asynchronous TLS handshake callback (CVE-2026-72222)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: sunrpc: wait for in-flight TLS handshake callback when cancel loses race (CVE-2026-72221)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: fs/resctrl: Fix use-after-free during unmount (CVE-2026-72080)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: sctp: clear new_transport when removing a peer (CVE-2026-74586)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: openvswitch: Fix CT limit teardown use-after-free (CVE-2026-89488)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: PCI/sysfs: Add lockdown checks to legacy I/O and memory handlers (CVE-2026-90315)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;kernel: kernel: xfs: Unauthorized data modification via improper file size exchange handling (CVE-2026-98974)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://access.redhat.com/errata/product/479/ver=/rhel---10/x86_64/RHSA-2026:95367" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://access.redhat.com/errata/product/479/ver=/rhel---10/x86_64/RHSA-2026:95367&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
